         <div type="bio">
            <p>Prominent member of the UK Labour Party and, from 1929-1935, Prime Minister. His reputation suffered severely as a result of financial issues resulting from the 1929 Wall Street crash and his formation of a coalition Conservative and Labour government in 1931. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
